{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2605\u2190\u25cf. (Reply the orbs to the star.)</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2605\u2606\u2605 (Basics)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2460\u25b3\u2192  \u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605 (The Journey to the Stars!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2461\u25b3\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u2190\u25cf     \u2605\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 (The stars speak to you with glowing orbs)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2462\u25b3/\u25cf\u2192\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u2605\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 (Return the ball to the stars with your own hands!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2463\u25b3\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u25cf/\u2605\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 (When the star receives the ball...)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2464\u25b3\u00a0 \u00a0 \u2190+\u25cf+\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 +\u2605\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 (The star\u2019s light grows stronger, and the ball transforms!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2465\u25cf=\u2191  \u3007=\u2193\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0(Don\u2019t return the stars that do not shine.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2466\u2605\u231b  \u2192\u25b3\u2192   \u2605\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 (When time is up, you travel to the next star.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2467\u2605++\u2605++\u2605++++\u2605+++++\u00a0 \u00a0 (Return as many balls as you can!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2190\u25b3\u2192 (Controls) </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbMove Left/Right</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000Keyboard: \u2190 / \u2192 Arrow Keys or A / D</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000Gamepad: Left Stick or D-Pad (Left/Right)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbSelect in Menu &amp; Pause Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000Keyboard: Enter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000Gamepad: ABXY Buttons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >!!! (Notes)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThis work uses all 16 pieces from the suite &quot;Pictures at an Exhibition.&quot; (Total 30 minutes)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000The visual representation of each piece is based on the personal interpretations and associations of the creator, Sasayaka.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"88 at an Exhibition","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3758690/4c3c8b684668ea47ebcc863b334a56dd37020074.jpg"},{"name":"01 at an Exhibition","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3758690/c82c5e259a095b0403ef0ab1b1136a189c0cdab4.jpg"},{"name":"00 at an Exhibition","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3758690/15e48de630660002ede10d9051974a5c176fbfc2.jpg"},{"name":"Golden Record","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3758690/5e055072fdadd3122bfe98a364f0643a7a1bae0a.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3758690?t=1757898706","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3758690?t=1757898706","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758690/5489726f1517bc6b7992e133d798f8b0cfc6e929/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757898706","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758690/5489726f1517bc6b7992e133d798f8b0cfc6e929/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757898706","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"desc